---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy | CoHealthNews" description="How CoHealthNews handles visitor data, cookies and advertising.">
  <article class="article">
    <div class="narrow">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="meta">Last updated: replace with today's date</p>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>This is a starter template. Replace it with a complete policy before you apply for ads. A free generator such as the ones from Termly or iubenda is a reasonable starting point, and you should check it against your own setup.</p>
        <h2>Information we collect</h2>
        <p>We use Google Analytics to understand how visitors use the site. It may collect your IP address, browser type and the pages you visit.</p>
        <h2>Cookies and advertising</h2>
        <p>We and our advertising partners may use cookies to show ads and measure performance. Visitors can control cookies in their browser settings.</p>
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>For privacy questions, email hello@cohealthnews.com.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
